/* Symbol chords, generated by draw/gen_symbols.py from its TABLE.
 * State order: plain, Shift, Cmd, Shift+Cmd, Alt, Shift+Alt, Ctrl, Shift+Ctrl;
 * the mod comes from the hand opposite the pair. Do not edit by hand. */

